AND HE WAS THE CONSENSUS PICK.

00:00:12.433 --> 00:00:20.073
NOW IT'S NOT AS CLEAR.

00:00:20.074 --> 00:00:20.874
ACCORDING TO THE REPORTS THOUGH

00:00:20.875 --> 00:00:21.441
THE BIDEN CAMPAIGN IS

00:00:21.442 --> 00:00:25.612
CONSIDERING A NEW AND BOLD

00:00:25.613 --> 00:00:26.013
STRATEGY.

00:00:26.014 --> 00:00:27.681
WHAT IF BIDEN PROMISED TO SERVE

00:00:27.682 --> 00:00:30.050
