00:00:30.051 --> 00:00:30.517
WHAT THAT WORK?

00:00:30.518 --> 00:00:31.485
OR WOULD IT SERVE ONLY TO

00:00:31.486 --> 00:00:36.957
EMPHASIZE HIS ADVANCED AGE.

00:00:36.958 --> 00:00:38.325
HERE'S THE HOST OF DAILY

00:00:38.326 --> 00:00:39.593
BRIEFING.

