SO FOR HIM TO SAY I WILL SERVE

00:00:43.731 --> 00:00:51.038
ONLY ONE TERM, APPEARS TO BE

00:00:51.039 --> 00:00:51.405
CONCEDING.

00:00:51.406 --> 00:00:52.072
&gt;&gt; I THINK IT'S INTERESTING

00:00:52.073 --> 00:00:54.574
