00:01:04.285 --> 00:01:10.157
THEY ARE SAYING WHAT DO PEOPLE

00:01:10.158 --> 00:01:10.657
THINK ABOUT THIS?

00:01:10.658 --> 00:01:15.328
AND THAT EMPHASIZES THE

00:01:15.329 --> 00:01:23.437
WEAKNESSES.

