00:01:24.105 --> 00:01:24.838
PEOPLE ARE SAYING WHAT AMERICANS

00:01:24.839 --> 00:01:28.909
WANT AS AN END TO THE CHAOS.

00:01:28.910 --> 00:01:31.511
AND I HAVE A FEW BIG PROBLEMS

00:01:31.512 --> 00:01:32.779
WITH THE IDEA OF RUNNING FOR

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:34.381
PRESIDENT AND SAYING YOU ARE

00:01:34.382 --> 00:01:43.356
ONLY GOING TO RUN FOR ONE TERM.

00:01:43.357 --> 00:01:47.027
AND HOW COULD YOU REBUILD THE

00:01:47.028 --> 00:01:47.961
