00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:28.602
&gt;&gt; AND THAT COULD BE THE EFFECT

00:02:28.603 --> 00:02:30.070
FOR THE NOMINEE THREE YEARS FROM

00:02:30.071 --> 00:02:33.974
