00:02:50.158 --> 00:02:51.291
IMMEDIATELY SHE THINKS THAT

00:02:51.292 --> 00:02:54.261
SHE'S A FRONT RUNNER TO RUN IN

00:02:54.262 --> 00:02:56.263
2024 BECAUSE WHY WOULD SHE THINK

00:02:56.264 --> 00:02:57.030
THAT?

00:02:57.031 --> 00:02:57.731
THEY WOULD BE SURROUNDED BY

00:02:57.732 --> 00:03:01.535
PEOPLE WHO WANT TO TAKE HER OUT.

00:03:01.536 --> 00:03:03.170
&gt;&gt; SO YOU JUST EXPLAINED IN

00:03:03.171 --> 00:03:04.337
ABOUT TWO AND A HALF MINUTES WHY

00:03:04.338 --> 00:03:05.038
THIS IS THE WORST IDEA ANYONE

00:03:05.039 --> 00:03:07.474
