00:03:07.475 --> 00:03:10.377
&gt;&gt; I DON'T KNOW IF EVER BUT,

00:03:10.378 --> 00:03:11.711
THEY THROW THE STUFF OUT THERE

00:03:11.712 --> 00:03:14.281
AND, JOE BIDEN IS STILL DOING

00:03:14.282 --> 00:03:16.383
VERY WELL NATIONALLY IN THE

00:03:16.384 --> 00:03:18.151
POLLS.

00:03:18.152 --> 00:03:20.220
&gt;&gt; AMAZING.

00:03:20.221 --> 00:03:21.388
YOU PREDICTED FROM THE BEGINNING

00:03:21.389 --> 00:03:25.358
